graph TD
    %% OMP Synthesis
    A[OMP Gene Transcription] --> B[Ribosome Translation]
    B --> C[N-terminal Signal Sequence]
    C --> D[Unfolded OMP Polypeptide]
    
    %% Sec Translocation
    D --> E[SecB Chaperone Binding]
    E --> F[SecB-OMP Complex]
    F --> G[Delivery to SecYEG]
    G --> H{AND: SecA ATPase<br/>AND ATP?}
    H -->|No| I[/Translocation Blocked/]
    H -->|Yes| J[SecYEG Translocon]
    
    J --> K[Polypeptide Threading]
    K --> L[Signal Peptidase Cleavage]
    L --> M[OMP in Periplasm]
    
    %% Periplasmic Chaperone Handoff
    M --> N{OR: Which<br/>Chaperone?}
    N -->|Major - SurA| O[SurA Binding]
    N -->|Alternative - Skp| P[Skp Binding]
    N -->|Quality Control - DegP| Q[DegP Protease]
    
    %% SurA Pathway
    O --> R[SurA PPIase Activity]
    R --> S[Proline Isomerization]
    S --> T[OMP Partially Folded]
    T --> U[SurA-OMP Complex]
    
    %% Skp Pathway
    P --> V[Skp Trimer]
    V --> W[Hydrophobic Cavity]
    W --> X[OMP Protected from Aggregation]
    X --> Y[Skp-OMP Complex]
    
    %% DegP Quality Control
    Q --> Z{AND: OMP Misfolded<br/>AND High Temp?}
    Z -->|No| AA[Chaperone Activity]
    Z -->|Yes| AB[Protease Activity]
    AB --> AC[/Degradation/]
    AC --> AD[/Failed OMPs Removed/]
    
    %% BAM Complex Recognition
    U --> AE[Delivery to BAM]
    Y --> AE
    AA --> AE
    AE --> AF[BAM Complex at OM]
    
    %% BAM Complex Assembly
    AF --> AG{AND: BamA + BamB<br/>+ BamCDE?}
    AG -->|No - Missing Subunits| AH[Assembly Fails]
    AG -->|Yes - Complete| AI[/Functional BAM Complex/]
    
    AI --> AJ[BamA β-Barrel Core]
    AJ --> AK[BamB Substrate Recognition]
    AK --> AL[BamC/D/E Lipoproteins]
    
    %% β-Barrel Recognition
    AL --> AM{AND: β-Barrel Signature<br/>Motif Present?}
    AM -->|No - Not OMP| AN(\1)
    AM -->|Yes - OMP Motif| AO[Substrate Captured]
    
    AO --> AP[C-terminal β-Signal]
    AP --> AQ[Aromatic Residues]
    AQ --> AR[BamA Recognition]
    
    %% Insertion Mechanism
    AR --> AS{AND: BamA Lateral<br/>Gate Open?}
    AS -->|No| AT[Gate Closed]
    AS -->|Yes| AU[Lateral Gate Opening]
    
    AU --> AV[OMP Enters BamA Barrel]
    AV --> AW[β-Strand Insertion]
    AW --> AX[Strand-by-Strand Threading]
    AX --> AY[β-Barrel Nucleation]
    
    %% Lipid Interaction
    AY --> AZ{AND: Lipid Bilayer<br/>Access?}
    AZ -->|No| BA[Insertion Stalled]
    AZ -->|Yes| BB[β-Barrel Interacts with Lipids]
    
    BB --> BC[Amphipathic β-Strands]
    BC --> BD[Hydrophobic Face to Lipids]
    BD --> BE[Hydrophilic Face to Interior]
    
    %% β-Barrel Closure
    BE --> BF{AND: First + Last<br/>Strands Meet?}
    BF -->|No| BG[Partial Barrel]
    BF -->|Yes| BH[β-Barrel Closes]
    
    BH --> BI[Hydrogen Bonding]
    BI --> BJ[Stable β-Barrel]
    BJ --> BK[Release from BamA]
    
    %% Final OMP Structure
    BK --> BL[OMP in Outer Membrane]
    BL --> BM{OR: OMP<br/>Function?}
    BM -->|Porin| BN[Small Molecule Transport]
    BM -->|Adhesin| BO[Surface Attachment]
    BM -->|Enzyme| BP[Catalytic Activity]
    BM -->|Receptor| BQ[Signal Transduction]
    
    BN --> BR([Functional OMP])
    BO --> BR
    BP --> BR
    BQ --> BR
    
    %% Failed Assembly
    I --> BS[/Cytoplasmic Degradation/]
    AH --> BS
    AN --> BT[/Periplasmic Degradation/]
    BA --> BT
    BG --> BT
    BT --> BU([Quality Control])
    
